#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:5
#: d2f8e0249b1946f3b4cb9789541878f6
msgid "Autopilot Output Functions"
msgstr "飞控输出功能"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:7
#: f21593867f4349b5a5f85bd76b99fff9
msgid ""
"All autopilot servo/motor outputs may be mapped to any output function "
"supported by ArduPilot. This page describes how to configure these output "
"channels and what each of the available functions that can be assigned to an"
" output are."
msgstr "所有飞控舵机/电机输出均可映射到 ArduPilot 支持的任意输出功能。本页介绍如何配置这些输出通道，以及可分配给输出的各个可用功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:11
#: aab0de1ed35a41fcaaecef976d22d486
msgid ""
"ArduPilot supports up to 32 outputs. These may be via DroneCAN ESCs or "
"directly from autopilot outputs, or a mixture of both."
msgstr "ArduPilot 最多支持32路输出。这些输出可通过 DroneCAN ESC 或直接通过飞控输出，或两者混合使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:13
#: 46c7bad19e0743ebbb9848e16273cee1
msgid ""
"See the left sidebar menu for major output categories to navigate to desired"
" functions on this page quickly."
msgstr "请查看左侧边栏菜单中的主要输出类别，以快速导航到本页所需功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:18
#: 8fd188655d4f4ceab9c4d5fce9fb958d
msgid "The SERVOn_FUNCTION parameters"
msgstr "SERVOn_FUNCTION 参数"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:20
#: 60cdb9e2c09b499c8695f6e1d786ef60
msgid ""
"In the advanced parameter view of your GCS you will find that each SERVO "
"output channel has a ``SERVOn_FUNCTION`` parameter. For example, "
":ref:`SERVO5_FUNCTION<SERVO5_FUNCTION>`  controls the output function of "
"channel 5, :ref:`SERVO6_FUNCTION<SERVO6_FUNCTION>` controls the output "
"function of channel 6 and so on."
msgstr ""
"在地面站的高级参数视图中，每个 SERVO 输出通道都有一个 ``SERVOn_FUNCTION`` "
"参数。例如，:ref:`SERVO5_FUNCTION<SERVO5_FUNCTION>` "
"控制通道5的输出功能，:ref:`SERVO6_FUNCTION<SERVO6_FUNCTION>` 控制通道6的输出功能，依此类推。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:23
#: 0711fc8e83e3460d80ccfd7a38cb45e1
msgid ""
"Not all the functions are available in each vehicle. Defaults are set to 0 "
"when firmware for a vehicle type is first loaded. Choosing a frame "
"configuration in Mission Planner during initial setup will set the outputs "
"to the basic typical functions for that frame type. For example, fixed wing "
"plane will set the first four outputs, SERVO1-SERVO4 to Aileron, Elevator, "
"Throttle, and Rudder functions, respectively."
msgstr ""
"并非所有功能在每种机型中都可用。首次加载某机型固件时，默认值设为0。在初始设置期间，在 Mission Planner "
"中选择机架配置将把输出设置为该机架类型的典型基本功能。例如，固定翼飞机会将前四路输出 SERVO1-SERVO4 "
"分别设为副翼、升降舵、油门和方向舵功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:27
#: 2941b212e5b647808dddd85d3cbac54e
msgid ""
"All of these functions may be used on multiple channels. So if you want 3 "
"elevator channels for some reason you can set ``SERVOn_FUNCTION`` to 19 on 3"
" of your output channels."
msgstr ""
"所有这些功能都可在多个通道上使用。因此，如果您出于某种原因需要3路升降舵通道，可以在3个输出通道上将 ``SERVOn_FUNCTION`` 设为19。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:32
#: ee1c1f7b844648219c4d6be51f575557
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:34
#: d8ca1b54b6644b9bbb79322eb97c61e5
msgid ""
"Configuration can be done using the SERVO tab of Mission Planner or by "
"directly setting the ``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` parameter for an output."
msgstr "可通过 Mission Planner 的 SERVO 标签页进行配置，或直接设置某输出的 ``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` 参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:39
#: af0ace21beba48448fda1fdf9eaedd81
