"the :ref:`kitty-corner default <connect-escs-and-motors>` to a more logical "
"clockwise method, make these changes:"
msgstr ""
"例如，如果您希望将 Copter 四轴 X 型机架的电机顺序从 :ref:`对角线默认 <connect-escs-and-motors>` "
"调整为更直观的顺时针方式，请进行如下更改："

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:41
#: 36d50f7f89dd43f4bf67d07209a17c17
msgid ""
":ref:`SERVO1_FUNCTION <SERVO1_FUNCTION>` leave as 33 (aka \"motor1\", front-"
"right)"
